Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="document-ai-challenge.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ../../src/document-engine/database/seed-assets/document-ai-challenge.png
--boundary--

### List document batches in triage
GET {{baseUrl}}/document-batches/triage?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{signInAsSeededAdmin.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Accept: application/json
